# Atlas Core Component Design Tokens Specification (v1.2)
**Author:** Prism Bishop  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D15 06:20  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Complete component design token definitions in W3C DTCG format for Project Atlas Core, bridging SaaS platform and Face to Face service UI states based on guidelines from Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "meta": {
    "name": "Atlas Core Component Tokens",
    "version": "1.2.0",
    "author": "Prism Bishop (Design / Docs Evangelist)",
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "documentation": {
      "source": "Business Document: Company Document",
      "usage": "Applied to align component visual primitives and accessibility baselines across I.T. Skokos SaaS and Face to Face customer service touchpoints, establishing contrast ratios (WCAG 2.1 AA/AAA) and physical touch target sizes."
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.600}", "$type": "color", "$description": "Primary CTA background for SaaS & service interfaces" },
        "background:hover": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.700}", "$type": "color" },
        "text": { "$value": "{color.neutral.0}", "$type": "color" },
        "padding": {
          "saas": { "$value": "8px 16px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "faceToFace": { "$value": "14px 24px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Enlarged touch boundary per Business Document: Company Document kiosk guidelines" }
        },
        "borderRadius": { "$value": "{radius.md}", "$type": "dimension" }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "surface": {
        "background": { "$value": "{color.neutral.50}", "$type": "color" },
        "border": { "$value": "1px solid {color.neutral.200}", "$type": "border" },
        "elevation": { "$value": "{elevation.level1}", "$type": "shadow" }
      }
    },
    "input": {
      "field": {
        "height": {
          "default": { "$value": "40px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "faceToFace": { "$value": "52px", "$type": "dimension" }
        },
        "border": { "$value": "1px solid {color.neutral.400}", "$type": "border" },
        "border:focus": { "$value": "2px solid {color.brand.primary.500}", "$type": "border" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```